",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/011-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/014-verify.json\",\"Reload production path for no-flag/--resume uses cwd-most-recent registry selection, not the prior resolved thread id.\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"not-required\",\"approvalSource\":null},{\"description\":\"Production --resume presents choices through notify but auto-selects most recent; there is no real operator selection in the production path.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/011-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/014-verify.json\",\"Production --resume presents choices through notify but auto-selects most recent; there is no real operator selection in the production path.\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"not-required\",\"approvalSource\":null}],\"cleanupRequired\":true},\"rulingRequest\":{\"id\":\"01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution-story-run-001-ruling-048\",\"decisionType\":\"spec-deviation-ruling\",\"question\":\"For Story 1, do you accept both declared deviations as satisfying story acceptance: (1) reload for no-flag/--resume reattaches to the cwd's most-recent registry thread instead of reconstructing from the prior resolved thread id, and (2) production --resume shows the cwd-scoped title/created/id list via ctx.ui.notify but auto-selects the most recent thread because PI v0.79.2 has no interactive selection surface?\",\"defaultRecommendation\":\"Do not accept the story unless both deviations are explicitly approved; if either is rejected, route back to implementation for that exact item.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/014-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/013-continue.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/stories/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution.md\"],\"allowedResponses\":[\"approve-both-deviations\",\"reject-reload-deviation\",\"reject-resume-picker-deviation\",\"reject-both-deviations\"]},\"recommendedImplLeadAction\":\"ask-ruling\"}},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"story-run-current\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/story-lead/001-current.json\"},{\"kind\":\"story-run-events\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\"},{\"kind\":\"story-run-final-package\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/01-session-lifecycle-and-thread-resolution/story-lead/001-final-package.json\"},{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/l