ssifyFailure pure stub (throws).\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:614:        reason: \"loadAssignments stub (throws; never returns a placeholder map).\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:617:        reason: \"ValidationReport re-export (spec'd home) + validateReachable/report stubs (throw).\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:622:        path: \"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/synthetic.ts\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:629:        reason: \"Deterministic ModelCall fakes: fakeModelCallText/fakeModelCallFailure/fakeModelCallRouter.\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:637:        path: \"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/synthetic.test.ts\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:641:        reason: \"ModelCall fakes well-formed: text, each failure kind, router routing + fail-closed on unrouted key.\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:657:        - \"packages/pi-lhc/test/fixtures/synthetic.test.ts\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:684:        - \"Held the anti-shim line on the two factory/result stubs that are easy to fake: createModelCall returns a fail-closed 'other' failure (never ok:true) and replayCorpus returns matches:false — neither reports success.\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:692:      - \"Q3 (tech design): M0 recorded-corpora breadth — the corpus loaders build synthetic stand-ins for the 5 named lifecycles 