{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260614215505d912a84986e64848","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have all the information I need to complete the epic review. Let me compile my findings:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"revise\",\n  \"crossStoryFindings\": [\n    \"Stories 0-4 are complete and verified with clear receipts in team-impl-log.md\",\n    \"Stories 5-6 (Inference Host Routing + Startup Validation) are implemented and gated\",\n    \"Cross-story consistency maintained: plain-data-only state, converter architecture, and idempotency design align across all stories\",\n    \"The capture spine (S0→S1→S2→S3) is strictly linear as designed\",\n    \"Fork (S4) and Inference (S5) branch correctly from the capture spine and lifecycle foundation\"\n  ],\n  \"architectureFindings\": [\n    \"The turn-derivation contract (PI turn ≠ LHC turn) is correctly implemented: TurnAccumulator ignores PI's per-step turn_end and emits exactly one LHC turn_end at agent_end\",\n    \"The converter follows the tech design: map-message (pure) → turn-accumulator (stateful) → converter (orchestrates batch flush)\",\n    \"Idempotency uses the 4-tier precedence system (entryId → toolCallId → responseId → fingerprint) as specified\",\n    \"Fork detection uses both hook-based (session_before_fork) and session-tree fallback as Epic 1 design allows\",\n    \"The plain-data-only rule is enforced: SessionState holds only threadRef and flags; no PI objects retained\",\n    \"The architecture-risk tests from tech-design §Testing Strategy are present: restart/reload, idempotency double-replay, adapter-boundary failure classification, atomicity isolation, source-vs-derived fork immutability\"\n  ],\n  \"epicCoverageAssessment\": [\n    \"All 6 AC-sets (AC-1.1 through AC-6.3) have corresponding tests\",\n    \"Test coverage: 142 tests across 20 test files pass (pi-lhc verify-all)\",\n    \"Corpus replay tests (Story 3) consume M0 corpora as fixtures and assert on read-back through real SQLite threads\",\n    \"The closed-loop test (TC-4.5) proves capture→derivation→recorded-outcome end-to-end\",\n    \"Architecture-risk tests cover: restart survival, idempotency dedup, adapter-boundary classification, atomicity isolation, source-vs-derived fork immutability, fixture validity, concurrency stale-write protection\",\n    \"TC-6.1 (corpus replay) and TC-6.2 (deterministic re-replay) provide golden-case coverage\",\n    \"Coverage gaps: limited M0 corpus breadth (widens as corpora arrive), image/file-ref handling decision pending (degrade-to-runtime_note interim is in place)\"\n  ],\n  \"productionPathFindings\": [\n    \"The pi-ai boundary is real: createModelCall dynamically imports @earendil-works/pi-ai at runtime (model-call.ts line 78-90), returning classified failure when unavailable—never fabricated text\",\n    \"Default assignments use a real PI model (openai-codex/gpt-5.4 per PI v0.79.2 catalog), not a placeholder\",\n    \"Test fixtures use deterministic ModelCall fakes (fakeModelCallText, fakeModelCallFailure, fakeModelCallRouter) at the mock boundary as designed\",\n    \"The closed-loop test wires through the real scheduler + drainSettled, not a fake derivation path\",\n    \"The replay harness drives through the real converter + intakeStream into temp SQLite threads, not mocked intake\",\n    \"Local PI type declarations (src/pi/types.ts, src/inference/pi-ai.ts) are a documented deviation—verified mirror of v0.79.2 research, environmental necessity, not a design change\",\n    \"The initLhc wrapper over createSdk is a spec-anticipated mechanical rename (tech-design A-4/Q2)\"\n  ],\n  \"blockingFindings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"EF-001\",\n      \"severity\": \"major\",\n      \"title\": \"LHC verify fails due to outdated SDK_ONLY_EXPORTS list\",\n      \"evidence\": \"packages/lhc/test/retirement.test.ts:62 expects export list to match checked-in SDK_ONLY_EXPORTS, but actual exports include FORM_KINDS, WORK_KIND_REGISTRY, lookupWorkHandler, assembleWorkHandlerMap not in the list\",\n      \"affectedFiles\": [\"packages/lhc/test/retirement.test.ts\", \"packages/lhc/src/sdk.ts\"],\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"LHC-Epic-05-TC-6.1\"],\n      \"recommendedFixScope\": \"same-session-implementor\",\n      \"blocking\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nonBlockingFindings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"EF-002\",\n      \"severity\": \"observation\",\n      \"title\": \"M0 inputs pending per spec\",\n      \"evidence\": \"M0 corpora breadth for Story 3 fixtures; image/file-ref handling decision (A-7); tool-call rendering choice\",\n      \"affectedFiles\": [\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/epic.md\"],\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"A-2\", \"A-7\"],\n      \"recommendedFixScope\": \"fresh-fix-path\",\n      \"blocking\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"EF-003\",\n      \"severity\": \"observation\",\n      \"title\": \"Local PI type declarations remain\",\n      \"evidence\": \"src/pi/types.ts and src/inference/pi-ai.ts declare local types instead of importing from @earendil-works packages (not yet installed)\",\n      \"affectedFiles\": [\"packages/pi-lhc/src/pi/types.ts\", \"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/pi-ai.ts\"],\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"Story-0-deviation-1\"],\n      \"recommendedFixScope\": \"fresh-fix-path\",\n      \"blocking\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"EF-004\",\n      \"severity\": \"observation\",\n      \"title\": \"createSdk→initLhc rename pending\",\n      \"evidence\": \"initLhc is a thin wrapper over createSdk; the mechanical rename is anticipated by tech-design A-4 but not yet landed in LHC\",\n      \"affectedFiles\": [\"packages/pi-lhc/src/lifecycle/instance.ts\"],\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"A-4\"],\n      \"recommendedFixScope\": \"fresh-fix-path\",\n      \"blocking\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unresolvedItems\": [\n    \"M0 corpora: fixture breadth for Story 3 verification widens as corpora arrive\",\n    \"M0 decision A-7: image/file-reference handling (placeholder vs intake-schema extension); degrade-to-runtime_note interim is in place\",\n    \"createSdk→initLhc rename in LHC package (mechanical, A-4)\",\n    \"Local PI type declarations swap to real imports when @earendil-works packages are installed (Epic 2/4 packaging)\",\n    \"PI extension input/selection API: real --resume operator selection deferred until PI exposes the surface (upstream request filed)\"\n  ],\n  \"gateResult\": \"pass\"\n}\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8b1b04c-6358-4278-8fe4-779266fa40d8","uuid":"e9b82ea3-0466-4ebd-9ccc-14e2c5be7420"}
